  "problem": "The velocity $v$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=4\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(t+1)+2t.$ Calculate the acceleration $a$ of the particle at time $t.$\n\n$a(t)=$\n{{field-1}}",
